From 5e0271a4d7f6f0aa0a2e08fab061357c1f4f517c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JohnSnow <110465696+JohnSnow14284@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 23:59:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 15/23] Guard level deletion, LOD/fade and backup fixes

Multiple fixes and features: add a LevelStorageAccess mixin to call ClientSessionEvents.sessionEnd before world deletion to avoid Windows/RocksDB races; harden sessionEnd ownership checks. Add SimpleBackups mixin to exclude the live 'voxy' cache from archives and register it in the mixin plugin. Improve LOD rendering and boundary behavior: pass camera block origin/fraction to shaders, compute per-vertex boundaryDistanceSquared, adjust leaf cutout threshold and independent-water handling, and replace Bayer dither with a stable world-aligned dither. Distant beacon rendering now widens and scales beam cores with distance. VoxyTool: delay/ retry initial seasonal refresh using a weak level ref and countdown to avoid premature refreshes.
